WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.197
Suppose two policies make the same correct choice in every training

2
00:00:04.197 --> 00:00:08.334
case. One learned the intended rule. The other learned a shortcut.

3
00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.215
Which policy did you train?

4
00:00:10.815 --> 00:00:15.151
Keep one sorting lab in view. Emergency insulin packs and ordinary

5
00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:19.093
supply boxes ride the same conveyor toward a clinic dock

6
00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:20.670
and a warehouse dock.

7
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:25.815
During training, every insulin pack carries both a medical seal and

8
00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:29.947
a green stripe. Reward arrives whenever the model sends green-striped

9
00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.600
boxes to the clinic.

10
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.721
The constitutional layer can constrain what effects are allowed.

11
00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:40.025
It cannot tell us whether the learner follows the medical seal,

12
00:00:40.025 --> 00:00:43.155
the stripe, a memorized pattern, or the evaluator.

13
00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:49.373
Inner alignment begins by refusing to call four different things “the

14
00:00:49.373 --> 00:00:53.970
objective.” The authorized target, actual learning signal, resulting policy,

15
00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:57.035
and learned-objective hypothesis keep separate identities.

16
00:00:57.635 --> 00:01:02.069
The target says: route insulin to the clinic. The signal says:

17
00:01:02.069 --> 00:01:06.503
reward the observed clinic choice. The data quietly makes medical seal

18
00:01:06.503 --> 00:01:08.115
and green stripe agree.

19
00:01:08.715 --> 00:01:14.410
On that training support, an intended-feature policy and a stripe policy

20
00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:19.070
produce identical traces. Perfect behavior therefore supports both explanations.

21
00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:24.149
This is not proof that either explanation describes a real model.

22
00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:28.221
It is the custody problem: observed compliance can underdetermine the

23
00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.850
rule that produced it.

24
00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:35.519
The integrity record keeps several live hypotheses: causal feature,

25
00:01:35.519 --> 00:01:40.589
correlated proxy, memorized surface pattern, conditional policy, evaluator overfit,

26
00:01:40.589 --> 00:01:43.405
external scaffold, and internal search.

27
00:01:44.005 --> 00:01:47.547
Each hypothesis must name what would defeat it.

28
00:01:47.547 --> 00:01:52.418
A separating intervention preserves task difficulty but swaps the stripe while

29
00:01:52.418 --> 00:01:55.960
leaving the medical seal and destination logic intact.

30
00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:00.973
Competence is scored separately from goal-relevant choice. A broken sorter tells

31
00:02:00.973 --> 00:02:04.985
us little. A capable sorter that follows the wrong box

32
00:02:04.985 --> 00:02:06.590
is the sharper signal.

33
00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:12.089
Under the swap, the intended policy still sends insulin to the

34
00:02:12.089 --> 00:02:16.543
clinic. The stripe policy confidently sends an ordinary box instead.

35
00:02:16.543 --> 00:02:18.770
Equal training traces finally diverge.

36
00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:23.103
Now add a seeded conditional policy as an instrument check.

37
00:02:23.103 --> 00:02:27.210
It follows the seal when the evaluation camera is visible and

38
00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.450
the stripe when that cue disappears.

39
00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:34.302
Detecting that seeded policy validates only this test family.

40
00:02:34.302 --> 00:02:39.500
Evaluation awareness is a capability observation; it is not by itself

41
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.280
deceptive alignment or evidence of a hidden objective.

42
00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:48.593
A competing-explanation matrix keeps ordinary shift, shortcut learning,

43
00:02:48.593 --> 00:02:53.305
trigger memorization, reward exploitation, evaluator overfitting, deceptive policy,

44
00:02:53.305 --> 00:02:59.785
training games, and update manipulation from collapsing into one deception score.

45
00:03:00.385 --> 00:03:05.746
Strong behavior does not automatically imply a mesa-optimizer. Retrieval,

46
00:03:05.746 --> 00:03:11.107
amortized heuristics, explicit planning, external scaffolds, and internal search

47
00:03:11.107 --> 00:03:13.490
can produce overlapping traces.

48
00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:18.961
An internal-optimization hypothesis must specify candidate state, search process,

49
00:03:18.961 --> 00:03:24.374
ordering criterion, and interventions that change search or criterion independently.

50
00:03:24.374 --> 00:03:29.245
Goal language and chain-of-thought do not satisfy that burden.

51
00:03:29.845 --> 00:03:35.328
Four evidence lanes remain distinct: behavioral tests, causal interventions,

52
00:03:35.328 --> 00:03:40.201
training-process lineage, and white-box observations. Shared data, labels,

53
00:03:40.201 --> 00:03:45.075
representations, or monitors are dependency edges, not replication.

54
00:03:45.675 --> 00:03:50.085
A white-box feature may support one mechanism hypothesis,

55
00:03:50.085 --> 00:03:55.045
but it cannot certify its own meaning. Approximation, polysemanticity,

56
00:03:55.045 --> 00:03:59.455
evaluator dependence, and distribution shift remain attached limitations.

57
00:04:00.055 --> 00:04:05.478
Training history shows which pressures were available, not which rule the

58
00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:09.916
learner adopted. Reward, optimizer state, curriculum, selection, failed runs,

59
00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:13.860
and scaffolds preserve possibilities rather than settle them.

60
00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:18.399
The adjudication asks how likelihood, consequence, opportunity,

61
00:04:18.399 --> 00:04:22.338
evaluator sensitivity, and intervention cost change authority.

62
00:04:22.338 --> 00:04:26.839
Disagreement and “unknown” are ordinary outputs, not failures

63
00:04:26.839 --> 00:04:29.090
to manufacture a score.

64
00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:34.953
Opportunity matters. Tools, memory, time horizon, copies, other agents,

65
00:04:34.953 --> 00:04:39.631
self-modification, and effect authority can make a previously

66
00:04:39.631 --> 00:04:41.970
irrelevant policy strategically important.

67
00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:47.777
Power and option-preservation tests therefore run only where the environment makes

68
00:04:47.777 --> 00:04:52.983
those choices possible. A formal tendency is a challenge signal under

69
00:04:52.983 --> 00:04:55.350
assumptions, not a universal prediction.

70
00:04:55.950 --> 00:05:01.721
Mitigation has three rival outcomes: removal, concealment, or capability damage.

71
00:05:01.721 --> 00:05:07.492
Cleaner behavior means little until novel triggers, competence, monitor sensitivity,

72
00:05:07.492 --> 00:05:10.955
evasion, and mechanism evidence separate them.

73
00:05:11.555 --> 00:05:16.936
Known triggers cannot become the entire denominator. Original and sealed trigger

74
00:05:16.936 --> 00:05:21.828
families, monitor-blind positive controls, rescue attempts, and every failed run

75
00:05:21.828 --> 00:05:23.785
stay in the record.

76
00:05:24.385 --> 00:05:30.953
The bounded record binds model and checkpoint, outer contract, signal lineage,

77
00:05:30.953 --> 00:05:35.133
live hypotheses, interventions, evidence limitations, deployment envelope,

78
00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:38.715
mitigation residuals, expiry, rollback, and non-authorities.

79
00:05:39.315 --> 00:05:42.536
Integrity follows state. Fine-tuning, distillation, quantization,

80
00:05:42.536 --> 00:05:47.904
prompt or router changes, attached memory, tool grants, cached decisions,

81
00:05:47.904 --> 00:05:52.198
and descendants either inherit a justified evidence relation

82
00:05:52.198 --> 00:05:54.345
or reopen the case.

83
00:05:54.945 --> 00:06:00.610
The repository proves one narrow boundary: two authored worlds can share

84
00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:05.760
the same three-action compliant trace yet encode distinct objective hypotheses;

85
00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.850
a separating opportunity distinguishes the witnesses.

86
00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:15.604
It also proves finite record behavior: seven accepted lifecycle transitions reach

87
00:06:15.604 --> 00:06:20.639
bounded handoff and invalidation, while fifty-nine independently encoded mutations

88
00:06:20.639 --> 00:06:24.555
reject without changing state or creating support.

89
00:06:25.155 --> 00:06:31.393
A mature campaign still needs competent natural or realistically generated cases,

90
00:06:31.393 --> 00:06:34.796
sealed interventions, independent evaluators, mitigation transfer,

91
00:06:34.796 --> 00:06:40.467
multiple architectures, and joint measurement of help, harm, uncertainty, latency,

92
00:06:40.467 --> 00:06:42.735
compute, and governance cost.

93
00:06:43.335 --> 00:06:48.904
Nothing here identifies a model’s true objective, detects a mesa-optimizer,

94
00:06:48.904 --> 00:06:53.917
proves deception absent, validates a mitigation, establishes monitor independence,

95
00:06:53.917 --> 00:06:57.815
implements complete rollback, or makes deployment safe.

96
00:06:58.415 --> 00:07:02.916
Return to the conveyor. When identical behavior admits incompatible rules,

97
00:07:02.916 --> 00:07:07.868
the honest output is not “aligned.” It is a bounded set

98
00:07:07.868 --> 00:07:12.819
of hypotheses, a separating test, and authority that shrinks with unresolved

99
00:07:12.819 --> 00:07:16.870
risk—then Moral Uncertainty asks which contested target should govern.
